## Summary of Changes

1. **Project Service (`client/src/service/project.js`)**:
   - Added `searchProjectFiles()` method to search files across project and linked/child projects
   - Added `getRelatedProjects()` helper to find linked and child projects
   - Removed file mentions from `mentionList()` method

2. **Project Store (`client/src/store/project.js`)**:
   - Updated `buildMentions()` to exclude file mentions
   - Enhanced `searchMentions()` action to include file search results alongside user/profile mentions
   - File search happens dynamically when "@" is used

3. **Chat Component (`client/src/components/chat/Chat.vue`)**:
   - No changes to core functionality - it already handles both mentions and files properly
   - IntelliSense integration works transparently with the new file search

4. **IntelliSense Component (`client/src/components/chat/ChatIntelliSense.vue`)**:
   - Already supports displaying mixed suggestion types (users, profiles, projects, files)
   - Works seamlessly with combined results

The implementation ensures that:
- File search uses the API instead of pre-loaded mentions
- Search covers the project and all linked/child projects
- Results are deduplicated across projects
- UI remains responsive with proper suggestions display

